&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;饼子做我女朋友！——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raidwine&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6455279&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606397363&quot; alt=&quot;Raidwine&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6455279)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raidwine&quot;  &gt;Raidwine&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;已否决&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;《阿拉伯机械帝国史》，历史控深深得满足ing——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6591621&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606397363&quot; alt=&quot;Confucian Lee&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6591621)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee&quot;  &gt;Confucian Lee&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
