</div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">嘘别告诉Eule</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p style="text-align: center;">呜呜这个被我画崩了Eule看到别打我呜呜呜</p> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/auroriaaaaa/MTF1.png" alt="MTF1.png" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <p style="text-align: center;"></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">给Site-CN-10的MTF“纵深者”设计的logo</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">中分工具人Auroria——ZZZZZac</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p style="text-align: center;">有两个版本 你能相信我画了2163个图层嘛？嗯？</p> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/old-mother-hunters/MTF2.jpg" alt="MTF2.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/old-mother-hunters/MTF3.jpg" alt="MTF3.jpg" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <p style="text-align: center;"></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">给Site-CN-10的MTF“末日星云”设计的logo</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">涂抹真的超好玩我玩了一下午（</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p style="text-align: center;">第一版因为灰度的原因被毙了 第二版就长的粗暴了一些w</p> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/mountains/MTF5.jpg" alt="MTF5.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/old-mother-hunters/MTF4'.png" alt="MTF4'.png" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <p style="text-align: center;"></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-fo